# ── Newly identified unnecessary files ──────────────────────────────────────

# GTSRB raw dataset files — 50k+ image files and annotation CSVs.
# These are produced by extracting GTSRB_Final_Training_Images.zip.
# Share the original .zip via a release link, not the raw files.
*.ppm
GT-*.csv
metadata.yaml

# TFLite export build reports — generated by export_yolo_tflite.py, not source.
*_calibration_report.json
*_tensor_correspondence_report.json

# YOLO standalone OpenVINO IR files — produced by ultralytics export.
# The yolov8n_openvino_model/ directory is already ignored above.
yolov8n.xml
yolov8n.bin

# NumPy array dumps (calib_data.npy already above; catch any others)
*.npy

# Colab / Jupyter notebooks — training was done in Colab, these are large
# notebook files with embedded outputs. Share via Colab links instead.
colab/
*.ipynb

# FlatBuffers schema — auto-generated TFLite schema file, not hand-written.
schema.fbs
schema_generated.py

# Sweep / benchmark output logs
sweep.log
onnx2tf.log
Readme-Images.txt
